Transforming 'hit' to 'cog':
1. Start: queue = [['hit']], visited = {'hit'}
2. Process 'hit': generate neighbors → 'hot' (valid, not visited)
   queue = [['hit','hot']], visited = {'hit','hot'}
3. Process 'hot': generate neighbors → 'dot', 'lot', 'pot' (all valid)
   queue = [['hit','hot','dot'], ['hit','hot','lot'], ['hit','hot','pot']]
   visited = {'hit','hot','dot','lot','pot'}
4. Continue until 'cog' found, always checking visited before adding to queue.

